<h1 class="page-title">About Us</h1>
<p style="line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Welcome to <strong>Pretty Pickles</strong> — where tradition meets taste. We craft authentic homemade pickles and snacks using time-honoured recipes passed down through generations.</p>
<p style="line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">Every jar is prepared with the freshest ingredients, without any artificial preservatives or additives. Our goal is to bring the authentic taste of homemade pickles to your doorstep, no matter where you are in India.</p>
<p style="line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:16px;">We partner with local pickle makers who bring decades of expertise, ensuring each product delivers the rich, bold flavours you'd expect from a home kitchen.</p>
<p style="line-height:1.8;"><strong>Quality, Authenticity, and Taste</strong> — that's the Pretty Pickles promise.</p>
